# Update Protocol

When you modify code, update the matching `.kiro/steering/` file **and** matching `docs/` file before finishing. Change only the affected section — never rewrite whole files.

| Code area | Steering | Docs |
|---|---|---|
| Top-level / env / entry points | `project-overview.md` | `ARCHITECTURE.md` |
| Node base / ports / metadata | `node-base.md` | `NODE_SYSTEM.md` |
| Registry / discovery | `node-registry.md` | `NODE_SYSTEM.md` |
| Plugins / PluginPackage | `plugin-development.md`, `plugin-ecosystem.md` | `PLUGIN_GUIDE.md` |
| Orchestrator / IR / executor | `pipeline-execution.md` | `PIPELINE_EXECUTION.md` |
| API routers | `api-endpoints.md` | `API_REFERENCE.md` |
| `api/main.py` | `api-structure.md` | `API_REFERENCE.md` |
| SDK / CLI | `sdk-cli.md` | `SDK_AND_CLI.md`, `USERGUIDE.md` |
| Runs / artifacts / domain | `backend-services.md` | `BACKEND_CORE.md`, `DOMAIN_SERVICES.md` |
| MCP | `mcp-server.md` | `MCP_SERVER.md` |
| Models | `data-models.md` | `DATA_FLOW_AND_WORKSPACE.md` |
| graphyn-ui canvas / shell | `frontend-canvas.md` | — |
| graphyn-ui feature screens | `frontend-features.md` | — |

**Issues:** new → add to `KNOWN_ISSUES.md`. Fixed → remove from open tiers.
